  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Note: "Important steps: \n1. Add, if not there, the (EDIA) Eye-DataHandler and
    an Eye-Xxx-EyeDataConverter prefabs to the scene.\n2. Add an EyeOutlet component
    (from the EDIA_LSL package) to this GameObject.\n3. Make sure that both \"EyeDataClientLslPusher\"
    and \"EyeOutlet\" use the same Eye.\n4. Set the Sampling Rate (SR) on the \"EyeOutlet\"
    to the SR of your Eye Tracker (e.g., 120 Hz for the Vive Pro Eye) if the tracking
    is implemented accordingly; otherwise set it to the display refresh rate (e.g.,
    90 Hz)"
